---
title: "claimTokenAllocation (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_investor: caller is investor with position
    q_check_investor --> q_check_settled: hasSettled == false
    q_check_investor --> q_revert_settled: hasSettled == true
    q_revert_settled --> [*]: revert AlreadySettled
    q_check_settled --> q_check_supplied: tokensSupplied == true
    q_check_settled --> q_revert_supply: tokens not supplied
    q_revert_supply --> [*]: revert TokensNotSupplied
    q_check_supplied --> q_verify_alloc_sig: verify allocation signature
    q_check_supplied --> q_revert_sig1: invalid allocation sig
    q_revert_sig1 --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_verify_alloc_sig --> q_verify_vest_sig: allocation sig valid
    q_verify_vest_sig --> q_calc_alloc: verify vesting authorization signature
    q_verify_vest_sig --> q_revert_sig2: invalid vesting sig
    q_revert_sig2 --> [*]: revert InvalidVestingSignature
    q_calc_alloc --> q_check_vesting: calculate tokenAmount from cachedTokenAllocationRate
    q_check_vesting --> q_deploy_vesting: vesting terms present
    q_check_vesting --> q_direct_transfer: no vesting (immediate)
    q_deploy_vesting --> q_transfer_vested: deploy vesting contract, vestingAddress = new contract
    q_transfer_vested --> q_settle: transfer vested tokens to vesting contract
    q_direct_transfer --> q_settle: transfer tokens directly to investor
    q_settle --> [*]: hasSettled = true, emit TokensClaimed

    note right of q_calc_alloc
        INV-001: dual signature verification required (allocation + vesting)
        INV-002: tokenAmount = investedCapital * cachedTokenAllocationRate / 1e18
        INV-003: vesting contract deployed per-investor if vesting terms present
        INV-004: post-capital-withdrawal vesting modifications prohibited
    end note
